---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About — Zeqing Wang" description="About Zeqing Wang's research interests and approach to research engineering.">
  <section class="about-hero container">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>Research should be<br /><em>clear enough to build on.</em></h1>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-tinted">
    <div class="container about-grid">
      <aside>
        <p class="portrait-monogram" aria-label="Zeqing Wang initials">ZW</p>
        <dl>
          <div><dt>Research</dt><dd>Visual computing<br />3D representation<br />Intelligent systems</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Engineering</dt><dd>Python · Rust · Web</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Online</dt><dd><a href="https://github.com/Zing110" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">github.com/Zing110 ↗</a></dd></div>
        </dl>
      </aside>
      <div class="prose">
        <p class="lead">I am Zeqing Wang, a researcher and engineer interested in how computational systems perceive motion, represent geometry, and turn complex visual data into useful structure.</p>
        <p>My preferred way of working sits between research and implementation: formulate a precise question, build the smallest system that can test it, and make the result legible to the next person. That means I care about experimental rigor as much as code quality and reproducibility.</p>
        <p>This site is a living index of that work. A fuller academic record, including education, publications, and a downloadable CV, will be added once the material is ready for public release.</p>
        <div class="note-block">
          <span>Current note</span>
          <p>Open-source project details are available now on GitHub; additional academic material is being prepared.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
